    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>MAHWAH, N.J.,&nbsp;May 17, 2017&nbsp;/PRNewswire/ --&nbsp;Stryker Orthopaedics launched today the first of its three part video series &quot;Road Trip to a Healthier Lifestyle,&quot; featuring brand ambassadors Pro Football Hall of Famer, Jerome Bettis and PGA TOUR Professional and GetAroundKnee® recipient, Fred Funk as they take on fitness classes in Miami for the first time.1 To follow the series go to <a href=\"http://www.strykerchallenge.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.StrykerChallenge.com</a><br>\n</p>\n<p><b>Read the full article:</b></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/stryker-orthopaedics-debuts-first-episode-of-video-series-road-trip-to-a-healthier-lifestyle-featuring-jerome-bettis-and-fred-funk-300458559.html\" target=\"_blank\">PRNewswire</a></p>\n",
